{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "15a1bf0c-dbcf-8e53-b695-0eadd173da74",
  "created_at": "2026-01-18T13:52:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, thank you. Is this the number for the plow problems? I know City Hall is closed today, it's Sunday, so I called the storm line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:50:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. We're on this line outside regular hours. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:50:32-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow, it knocked over my mailbox. The whole thing is down, the post and the box. It was just a little snow this morning, a dusting only, and so cold out, but the plow came by and, [line breaks up] it is lying in the yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:50:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up on me there. The plow knocked over your mailbox, the post and all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:50:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, the post and the box, both. Thank you for asking again. The signal is not so good on my phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'm writing that down. Plow hit the mailbox, post is down. Did this happen this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This morning, yes. I heard the plow around nine, maybe, and then I went outside and saw it. My daughter is here at the kitchen table doing homework, she saw it too, she says the plow went too close to the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And can I get your name and a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Teresa Pacheco. P-A-C-H-E-C-O. The number is 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Teresa Pacheco, 401-555-0154. Let me read that back. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right, thank you. So you will log it? I want it on record that the plow did this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'm logging it right now as a plow damage report. Someone from Public Works will follow up with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Thank you very much. I am a little annoyed, because it is a new post. But thank you for writing it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:51:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Stay warm, Teresa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:52:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
